          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"a8c5e1300313\"><strong>Changes made:</strong></p><table data-local-id=\"c84a8b35-f371-4d52-bbfd-32ea8ce71e1e\"><tbody><tr><td data-local-id=\"9b73ef02113a\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"26911b69ba55\">Metadata Name</p></td><td data-local-id=\"1f87af52c9fa\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"18af4f213f9b\">Metadata Type</p></td><td data-local-id=\"c36311c6515b\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"2be94a30efb4\">Action</p></td><td data-local-id=\"f67db69b5966\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"442bb378c1cd\">Notes</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"10e733632438\"><p data-local-id=\"d540d5bffdf8\">POC_Deal_Screen_Manage_Affiliate_Links</p></td><td data-local-id=\"8f38204c368b\"><p data-local-id=\"afa93c664a76\">Flow</p></td><td data-local-id=\"5ad105f4ba60\"><p data-local-id=\"4d9c91b79922\">New Component</p></td><td data-local-id=\"9d6dae8c1be7\"><p data-local-id=\"4cbf5173a331\">Created a POC. Not final version - no deletion included</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"a312a1131912\"><p data-local-id=\"8147ff9251f9\">Deal__c.Edit_Links</p></td><td data-local-id=\"f440c4c1fd8f\"><p data-local-id=\"b04a41dcf640\">QuickAction</p></td><td data-local-id=\"b0e4c34b19ab\"><p data-local-id=\"13cd8efa4ced\">New Component</p></td><td data-local-id=\"a34b5e7e7a23\"><p data-local-id=\"2a85c4f8a97a\">Button to launch the flow - POC_Deal_Screen_Manage_Affiliate_Links</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"91926bd1c80a\"><p data-local-id=\"b0d4022e5ad6\">Deal_Record_Page_v2</p></td><td data-local-id=\"e0c4014fbbaf\"><p data-local-id=\"6894a0cc1dd3\">Flexipage</p></td><td data-local-id=\"2a5b77d8cf25\"><p data-local-id=\"c350f15dbb70\">Update Component</p></td><td data-local-id=\"92c57c2112f7\"><p data-local-id=\"4c8a521874a6\">Added the quick action button</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-local-id=\"e719dfd44c1c\"><strong>Testing:</strong> Validated in sandbox. Working as expected. Reps don&#039;t have access to “Edit Links”. <br><br><strong>Scenario 1: </strong>Jared Ali - Rep Profile</p><figure data-local-id=\"cffed1646f27\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"551\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"c7d18727-309b-4f6f-a8d5-14ab70c2b720\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-25 at 12.53.59 AM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure><p data-local-id=\"db5c4e215928\"></p><p data-local-id=\"2bec83c92eed\"><strong>Scenario 2: </strong>System Admin Profile. With Existing Links and without.</p><figure data-local-id=\"1199c8738c1b\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"551\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"9b0eb349-fadc-4021-8904-7b40f6604c02\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-25 at 12.57.11 AM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure><figure data-local-id=\"a829c8ef0baa\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"551\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"5a9f86f6-081b-4e13-bc63-5f5bef72c200\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-25 at 12.57.52 AM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure><p data-local-id=\"92da77a096d0\"></p><p data-local-id=\"b14c2fd367d7\"><br><br></p>",
