          "body": "<p>Completed/reviewed Link Editing work is being closed as Done. The older proposed &#039;Affiliate Links Edited&#039; checkbox / removal semantics are superseded by the common sync-trigger design in WAGR-455/WAGR-456 and the new safe deletion/exclusion rules in WAGR-491. Future changes should be made in those current tickets rather than rewriting this reviewed work.</p>",
